++
++- Arrange: `var lease = Acquire("a");`
++- Act: `lease.Dispose();`
++- Assert: `HasActiveOwner == false`、`RestoreCount == 1`
++
++**`Dispose_StaleAfterNewOwner_DoesNotClearNewOwner_AndDoesNotRestore`**
++
